<title>GUYANA: CRICKET-W.INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.INDIES V INDIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>GEORGETOWN, Guyana 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard at the close on the fourth day of the rain-ruined fifth and final test match between West Indies and India on Sunday.</p>
<p>India first innings</p>
